message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: "finmlcv: Leakage-proof evaluation for financial machine learning"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-27"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Tabasi
    given-names: Hossein
keywords:
  - combinatorial purged cross-validation
  - deflated Sharpe ratio
  - financial machine learning
  - embargo
abstract: >
  A Python library implementing purged k-fold, combinatorial purged
  cross-validation, embargo, triple-barrier labeling, a leakage audit,
  and the deflated Sharpe ratio, together with a toy experiment that
  contrasts these protocols with naive shuffled KFold.
